   - remove the visible seam between the back and front clip bands, for example by overlapping them, or by using the FloodSheet waterline swell instead of rectangular clips;
   - keep the lip and its white water legible so 'pushed off the edge' still reads.
   Remove the patch entirely only if the lip stays visible as a landmark.
3. Condition 2. The fresh timed phone review must confirm all of the following at 12.4 to 17.2 s:
   - no straight edge, seam or box anywhere in the creek water;
   - the car's slide off the lip and its carry past the oak and ledge are unchanged;
   - the repair does not shift the car or landmarks relative to the caption band.
